<li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/romainblachier/" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a></li>
<li><a href="https://france-formosa.org" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">Association France-Formosa</a></li>
</ul>
	</div>
</Page>
